inero", "timestamp": 1775526789, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "aicaanthony", "author_id": "6819582442", "id": "18331836250217802", "text": "No lo sé rick… algunos no pensamos igual. Me dicen “cuando vuelva quiere otra cosa?” Yo “ah si. No volveré” \nEn lo personal, eh ido a lugares donde jamás eh vuelto en mis 29 años de vida…  muy buen servicio? Claro. Pero simplemente no vuelvo… 🤷🏿‍♂️ \nLo hago yo mismo o busco otro lado más cercano o etc…", "timestamp": 1775436495, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "danielopez2408", "author_id": "1537574716", "id": "17912913123165919", "text": "Y ya lo hiciste? Te funcionó?", "timestamp": 1774625710, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "talo_1109", "author_id": "71614537521", "id": "17969966115009931", "text": "Esta muy gufi", "timestamp": 1774619323, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "jafet_cajina_areas_", "author_id": "75506006193", "id": "18088506775957187", "text": "Regreso en 5 años y les cuento si funciona", "timestamp": 1774464700, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DTUaxQ4jXvL/", "webpage_url_basename": "DTUaxQ4jXvL", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-lga3-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/613021800_17873157186480555_1592274818218285107_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ig_cache_key=MzgwNjc4NTMxOTYyNzIyNjA1OQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEyMTUuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=VTvzLwRRmfkQ7kNvwGKnNc3&_nc_oc=Ado6Y6dE7QOaPhmuKxKG2n9Y39El1_1zIJ96RNo7n9E6wJTrYpEFnnj5fK3tjhKG-FI&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=djUCtSJ4XBTMRjWI7Mc74g&_nc_ss=7b689&oh=00_AQLA2VNoBS9ytnZ99Fd3ammaYNAfrFBoVgQ3pJSlf_rbpQ&oe=6AA533AD", "display_id": "DTUaxQ4jXvL", "fulltitle": "Video by vent.asilenciosa", "upload_date": "20260110", "epoch": 1788826881, "format": "dash-1181275867533979v - 1080x1920 (DASH video)+dash-877107391366595a - audio o